// grove fork default layout (ADR-0020): no bars.
//
// Upstream zellij wrapped the content pane with borderless tab-bar and
// status-bar plugin panes. grove drives its own chrome natively (whichkey /
// nav / detail land in 110+), so the default startup layout is a single bare
// pane — the "no bars" default expressed in source, not via a bundled
// clear-defaults kdl. The companion `default.swap.kdl` keeps the same
// bars-free stance for auto-layout swaps.
layout {
    pane
}
